    "ledger": [
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "One Model Family, Two Gold-Level Results: Fine-Tuning Nemotron for IOI and IMO",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/nemotron-ioi-and-imo-2026",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T12:45:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:20.555Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Starting from Nemotron 3, our teams used supervised fine-tuning (SFT), reinforcement learning (RL), and feedback-driven inference to create systems that reached gold-medal level at both IMO 2026 and IOI 2026 .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/nemotron-ioi-and-imo-2026",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T12:45:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:20.555Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Nemotron 3 Ultra general, SFT, and RL checkpoints in a generate-verify-refine system",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/nemotron-ioi-and-imo-2026",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T12:45:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:20.555Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For competitive programming, we curated 22,000 problems and generated synthetic reasoning traces to train two specialists.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/nemotron-ioi-and-imo-2026",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T12:45:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:20.555Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The progression on IOI 2025 makes the value of specialization easy to see.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/nemotron-ioi-and-imo-2026",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T12:45:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:20.555Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For the stronger Ultra model, one SFT epoch was enough to outperform the fully post-trained Nano model across IOI, ICPC, and LiveCodeBench Pro.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/nemotron-ioi-and-imo-2026",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T12:45:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:20.555Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "That finding guided the competition-specific Ultra-CC system used for IOI 2026, which scored 535.4 out of 600.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/nemotron-ioi-and-imo-2026",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T12:45:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:20.555Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Starting from Nemotron 3 Ultra, we trained one specialist with SFT and another with RL.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/nemotron-ioi-and-imo-2026",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T12:45:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:20.555Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The RL model was trained on 9,597 proof problems selected near the model's capability frontier.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/nemotron-ioi-and-imo-2026",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T12:45:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:20.555Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Our earlier IOI 2025 Hugging Face post showed how test-time compute can push open-weight models to gold-level performance.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/nemotron-ioi-and-imo-2026",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T12:45:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:20.555Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Nemotron Labs IMO 2026 collection brings together the SFT and RL checkpoints, both training datasets, and Nemotron-IMO-Bench, a new benchmark of 200 olympiad-level problems.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/nemotron-ioi-and-imo-2026",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T12:45:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:20.555Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For competitive programming, the Nemotron-3-Ultra-CC model is available on Hugging Face, and the IOI paper provides the training recipe and the GenCorrect methodology.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://huggingface.co/blog/nvidia/nemotron-ioi-and-imo-2026",
        "source": "Hugging Face Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-07T12:45:31.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T06:32:20.555Z"
      }
